      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.14,
      "end_seconds": 7.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.13,
      "text": "hi, you know, doctor, I came as soon as they called me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.42,
      "end_seconds": 14.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.73,
      "end_seconds": 21.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Well, I've been having bleeding that is tailing off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.69,
      "end_seconds": 28.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.08,
      "end_seconds": 34.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "I, I'd say three weeks. Actually, no, closer to one week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 34.67,
      "end_seconds": 38.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. So, and leg swelling, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.27,
      "end_seconds": 42.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I haven't noticed any leg swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.17,
      "end_seconds": 47.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "A few quick ones: thoughts of harming the baby or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.9,
      "end_seconds": 54.14,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "No, no thoughts of harming the baby or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.16,
      "end_seconds": 59.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 61.48,
      "end_seconds": 63.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "no, that's all normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.22,
      "end_seconds": 68.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.71,
      "end_seconds": 70.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.66,
      "end_seconds": 75.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.02,
      "end_seconds": 79.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.26,
      "end_seconds": 83.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.07,
      "end_seconds": 89.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.51,
      "end_seconds": 92.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.87,
      "end_seconds": 98.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.89,
      "end_seconds": 105.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.64,
      "end_seconds": 109.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "um, I've never had an allergy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.73,
      "end_seconds": 113.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.47,
      "end_seconds": 118.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I take paracetamol, 1 gram, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.98,
      "end_seconds": 132.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.03,
      "end_seconds": 147.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.95,
      "end_seconds": 171.53,
      "duration_seconds": 6.58,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 121 over 75, pulse 84, temperature 36.4, oxygen saturation is 98 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.81,
      "end_seconds": 177.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.58,
      "end_seconds": 181.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "that's fine, I'll explain it soon"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.55,
      "end_seconds": 187.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.19,
      "end_seconds": 190.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.3,
      "end_seconds": 216.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.78,
      "text": "The womb has gone down well and the stitches are healing, with no redness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.97,
      "end_seconds": 234.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.29,
      "end_seconds": 239.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.07,
      "end_seconds": 263.72,
      "duration_seconds": 5.65,
      "text": "taking everything into account, this looks most like a normal postnatal recovery"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.4,
      "end_seconds": 267.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Will it it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.27,
      "end_seconds": 290.24,
      "duration_seconds": 21.97,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a normal postnatal recovery is my leading thought, not anything worse. Just to be sure I understood. You've had bleeding that is tailing off for one week, and no thoughts of harming the baby or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.19,
      "end_seconds": 291.89,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.43,
      "end_seconds": 332.0,
      "duration_seconds": 24.57,
      "text": "I want a blood count done, that's for postnatal tiredness. Rest when the baby sleeps and ask for help; contraception can be discussed at six weeks. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. We'll catch up in four weeks. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.29,
      "end_seconds": 336.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "great, thank you for your help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.77,
      "end_seconds": 339.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
